This is an adaption of the minimp3 library to be directly
included in a source project.

From https://github.com/lieff/minimp3 at commit 48e3a085f0e1a99446b34614e1e7f17f09dc2e82

The file minimp3.h is unmodified. Only the decoder is included,
not the minimp3_ex.h extensions. The file minimp3.c compiles the
implementation as a separate object.
